    <string name="carlink_lab_initial_note">This first build collects a report. It does not connect CarPlay yet. Your wired app stays separate.</string>
    <string name="carlink_lab_next">Share this report so we can choose the next connection test.</string>
    <string name="carlink_lab_limits">Not tested: Bluetooth socket connections, hotspot creation, iPhone pairing, authentication or a CarPlay session. Firmware feature flags and adapter presence do not prove wireless CarPlay works. A zero paired-device count does not prove Linkswell has a separate radio. Wi-Fi 5 GHz support does not prove a 5 GHz hotspot is available. Settings handlers may redirect internally; a settings component does not prove a working Bluetooth stack. An unreported handler may still accept the shortcut.</string>
    <string name="carlink_lab_privacy">Report includes device/build details, capability results and settings component names. Phone names, Bluetooth addresses, Wi-Fi names, pairing keys, IMEI and serial numbers are not collected.</string>
    <string name="carlink_lab_report_title">F-150 Wireless Lab %1$s — compatibility report</string>
    <string name="carlink_lab_report_scope">Passive Android checks only; radios and pairings are not changed.</string>
